      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatachu Saul tama, “Asech ayong. Nakaneni kidodikinae arimatoi alongaren ngikarikok a ngitunga kang ka Ngisirael daang. Bua atobongosi atopedorea ayong akilip Ekapolon Akuj na erai Akuj kon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sodi kirukosi Samuel ka ngesi tobongosi Giligal, kilip Saul Ekapolon Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani erumor todung Samuel tama, “Torikokinae ayong Agag lo erai ekapolon a Ngiamalek.” Bu Agag nikeng ebulit emarani, itami ebala, “Epipil chanai ibore be akitu en!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ebulit ... akitu en;",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kori etitiny itami ebala, “Iteni dir adaun apipilu a akitu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolim Samuel tama, “Ani aloger etiliworea ekileng kon ngaberu na emam ngide, idongi tokona itiokon dang emam ikoku.” Totubutubu Samuel Agag alongaren ekeno a ngakipeyos alo Giligal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
